    "Abstract": "This is High resolution satellite carries two PAN sensors with 2.5m resolution and fore-aft stereo capability. The payload is designed to cater to applications in cartography, terrain modeling, cadastral mapping etc.  Standard products are full scene (path-row) based geo-referenced as well as geo-orthokit  products.",
